{100}{}{Valtcupl}
{200}{}{You see a citizen of Vault 13.}
{1000}{}{You should leave. This isn't your place here anymore.}
{1001}{}{We really like it here.}
{1002}{}{We didn't think that you were coming back. You have such a nice room, and we were a
little crowded with her parents. I hope you don't mind.}
{1003}{}{Look, we could really use the space. I hope you will reconsider.}
{1004}{}{Thanks! We really appreciate it. We put your stuff in the trunk.}
{1005}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'ValtCupl00a']}
{1006}{}{Look, I don't want to argue with you, but you obviously don't deserve this room anymore.
Please leave.}
{1007}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BigUpReact']}
{1008}{}{Well, I don't know. You don't seem to be using it very often, and we sure could use the
space.}
{1009}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BigDownReact']}
{1010}{}{Gee, I didn't think you would still care about this place from what I've heard. You have
a good day. We'll go back to her mothers' place.}
